<title>USA: TABLE - Aceto Corp Q4 June 30 shr $0.41.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Aceto Corp Q4 June 30 shr $0.41.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE SUCCESS, N.Y. 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
